    <item>
      <title>3.7.0 (370.0.12)</title>
      <link>https://github.com/jayjay181818/StockBar/releases/tag/experimental-370.0.12</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:35:44 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>370.0.12</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:channel>experimental</sparkle:channel>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.4.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">Experimental build 370.0.12 of Stockbar 3.7.0. Changes since v3.7.0:

- Add an Experimental update channel that follows the experimental branch (#97)
- Record milestone 1: every merged change measured against the baseline (#96)
- Keep the popover chart's line from doubling back at a gap in time (#95)
- Size the in-memory price history arrays to fit (#93)
- Read the portfolio chart's history without each snapshot's positions (#92)
- Keep the app's log when a benchmark launch fails (#91)
- Keep each portfolio snapshot's positions in a sorted array (#90)
- Read the stored history at launch away from the main thread (#89)
- Record the Rust evaluation and add the script behind its figures (#88)
- Read stored portfolio history in batches (#87)
- Stop building test-coverage counters into release builds (#85)
- Add the benchmark procedure, the baseline and the experimental log (#84)</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/jayjay181818/StockBar/releases/download/experimental-370.0.12/Stockbar-370.0.12.zip" length="7164147" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Ip7WIh5+dU8TVZgMp4B15TbtQVwsxdu05TJrddiDXrFlZpc3zRkmyCEAsq/Ho29cmAM1XKBmy/XYVqPa8cvRCg=="></enclosure>
